        <item>
            <title>0.75</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 23:44:42 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1790896910</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.75</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Redesigned browser and editor tab strips share one new tab component. The browser also gets a raised look, a header overflow menu, clickable URL bar behavior, and a new animated shader start page.</li>
<li>The theme editor and the theme previews in Settings have been reworked, and the bundled theme defaults are updated.</li>
<li>Local code and text file links in chat messages now open in Addy&#x27;s editor.</li>
<li>Capped agent directives are now injected into every agent session, and the knowledge sections in the Memory view have new labels.</li>
<li>Antigravity chats now show MCP tool calls correctly, and Addy rescans the available models after you sign in.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Chat history is now stored as one file per conversation, so large histories load and save faster.</li>
<li>Hidden projects release their chat transcripts once they pass a memory budget and rebuild them when you show the project. This lowers memory use.</li>
<li>Restoring many chats at once is faster. Per-row layout is deferred during batch restore, and restores now start before the cache warms.</li>
<li>Chat images decode off the main thread as thumbnails sized for display.</li>
<li>Chat text views use a fixed clip view, which avoids extra work on every frame change and makes chat scrolling and resizing smoother.</li>
<li>Each project&#x27;s repository environment is cached instead of being resolved for every pane, so new panes open faster.</li>
<li>CSS edits made in the element inspector are written back to your source files, including CSS modules.</li>
<li>The inspector popover now closes when its browser pane is hidden or detached.</li>
<li>Highlighted pane strip resize gap on hover and while dragging.</li>
<li>Agent color swatches are now ordered yellow, orange, red, purple, blue.</li>
<li>The inspector edit badge now matches the shape of the Addy logo pill.</li>
<li>Server footer buttons stay pinned to the trailing edge when the curtain chevron is hidden.</li>
<li>Updated the Liquid package for the click-to-replay logo variation.</li>
<li>Clicking a file path link in chat now reveals the file in Finder with it selected, and link clicks are logged.</li>
<li>Memory search runs off the main thread, and memories are no longer re-embedded on every launch.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed a hang when dragging a pane to a new spot in the layout.</li>
<li>Removed main-thread blockers in caller lookup and the Plans pane, which fixes occasional freezes.</li>
<li>Various small fixes to settings, the sidebar, and pane strip layout.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
